WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Most people quote forecast accuracy completely wrong.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
If someone claims they're hitting 95%, don't just blindly trust them.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
You need to hit them with one crucial question.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.000
At what level?

5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Because here's the trap.

6
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Accuracy is basically 100 minus MAPE.

7
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
But MAPE at the category month level is always structurally higher than at the SQ week level.

8
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Why?

9
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Because all that messy item level noise just cancels out when you aggregate.

10
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
It's the exact same business, the exact same data, but a wildly different number.

11
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Now, don't get me wrong here.

12
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
An honest 30 point accuracy gain measured at the category month level is a massive, very real operational result.

13
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.000
But it's simply not comparable to an item level number, so you should never present it as one.

14
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Plus, here is the second trap.

15
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.000
A 30 point gain on the accuracy scale is not a 30% reduction in error.

16
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.000
People blur those two things constantly.

17
00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.000
So here is your iron cloud rule.

18
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.000
You always have to state three things.

19
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.000
The metric, the aggregation level, and the time bucket.

20
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.000
No level, no claim.

21
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.000
It's that simple.

22
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Planners who actually state their level get believed.

23
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Planners who just quote a naked percentage, well, they get audited.

24
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:19.000
Huge shout out to supply chain pro Vinayak Bhadani for this framework.

25
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.000
So go check your own dashboard right now.

26
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:24.000
What is your true SKU week accuracy?

27
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.000
Thank you very much.
